    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949750/extras/5581b7ee5de2c57abae023c68de0d6d0.avif?t=1653516622\" /></div><br>Slime Corp is a retro styled arcade top down shooter.<br><strong><br>The main goal of the game is to go on slime collection missions &amp; collect enough slime to meet your quota by shooting enemy slimes &amp; collecting their blood with a tractor beam.</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949750/extras/88bc8b1dba9aa7b5fbf622b0789eee5b.avif?t=1653516622\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Randomly generated levels &amp; procedural enemy generation<br></li><li> Unlockable weapons, different area styles, and different game modes.<br></li><li> Retro styled VFX &amp; SFX.<br></li><li> Lots and lots of pixel carnage.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949750/extras/5581b7ee5de2c57abae023c68de0d6d0.avif?t=1653516622\" /></div><br>Slime Corp is a retro styled arcade top down shooter.<br><strong><br>The main goal of the game is to go on slime collection missions &amp; collect enough slime to meet your quota by shooting enemy slimes &amp; collecting their blood with a tractor beam.</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949750/extras/88bc8b1dba9aa7b5fbf622b0789eee5b.avif?t=1653516622\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Randomly generated levels &amp; procedural enemy generation<br></li><li> Unlockable weapons, different area styles, and different game modes.<br></li><li> Retro styled VFX &amp; SFX.<br></li><li> Lots and lots of pixel carnage.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A minimalist top down shooter with slimes.",
